The MiniActivationFixture project keeps greeting logic in `src/greeting.js` and calls it from `src/index.js`.

✅ Correct example:
```js
export function greet(name) {
  return `Hello, ${name}!`;
}
```

❌ Forbidden example:
```js
export default (name) => `Hello, ${name}!`;
```

